  "limitations": [
    "Per-exchange limits are 30 seconds, 64 KiB, and one non-redirecting fetch. No request-wide OAuth-attempt budget is implemented yet.",
    "Completed-token cache has 256 slots, not a provider enrollment limit. Concurrent cold requests do not share in-flight I/O and may increase OAuth load.",
    "Endpoint policy/SSRF and authorization freshness are not resolved by token caching; token_uri configuration remains supported.",
    "Only Chat/Responses/Messages/Gemini callers pass cancellation here. Other modality/admin/real-time callers still need end-to-end auditing.",
    "Node 22, Workers runtime, production database, phased headers/TTFT/idle, physical crypto/SQL cancellation and durable write recovery remain unverified/incomplete.",
